The Clip Studio Paint `.clip` format support in this project was developed with
reference to clip_to_psd by dobrokot (MIT License):
https://github.com/dobrokot/clip_to_psd

No code from that project is included here; the parser in `src/clip/` is an
independent TypeScript implementation.

